                    {
                        "sense_id": "92cc9c88-b974-3c8f-be79-c5af2a84e793",
                        "entry_id": "d91c4972-7cda-3123-a2e1-c85f477b4e8f",
                        "glosses": [
                            "oligarchic"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "e26d5939-5dc4-471c-969c-a6dc382e4c28",
                                "sense_id": "92cc9c88-b974-3c8f-be79-c5af2a84e793",
                                "text": "Ей нра́вится поря́док стро́йный\nОлигархи́ческих бесе́д,\nИ хо́лод го́рдости споко́йной,\nИ э́та смесь чино́в и лет.",
                                "translation": "She liked the hieratic order\nOf oligarchic colloquies,\nThe chill of tranquil pride that awed her,\nAnd ranks and years that mixed at ease.",
                                "english": "She liked the hieratic order\nOf oligarchic colloquies,\nThe chill of tranquil pride that awed her,\nAnd ranks and years that mixed at ease."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
